---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base title="Memflex docs" desc="Quickstart, API reference, integrations, multilingual, hosting, security." path="/docs">
<div class="wrap" style="padding:64px 24px">
  <span class="eyebrow">Docs</span>
  <h1>Everything, no fluff.</h1>
  <div class="docs-grid" style="margin-top:30px">
    <nav class="docs-nav">
      <strong>Start</strong>
      <a href="/docs" class="active">Overview</a>
      <a href="/docs/quickstart">Quickstart</a>
      <strong>Build</strong>
      <a href="/docs/api">API reference</a>
      <a href="/docs/integrations">SDK &amp; frameworks</a>
      <a href="/docs/multilingual">Multilingual</a>
      <strong>Run</strong>
      <a href="/docs/hosting">Hosting</a>
      <a href="/docs/security">Security</a>
    </nav>
    <div class="doc">
      <h2>Pick your path</h2>
      <div class="grid2">
        <div class="card"><h3>5-minute quickstart →</h3><p>Install, first ask, first reflex hit, metrics. No API key needed.</p><p><a href="/docs/quickstart">Start →</a></p></div>
        <div class="card"><h3>API reference →</h3><p>Every endpoint, fields, and the OpenAI/Claude-compatible routes.</p><p><a href="/docs/api">Read →</a></p></div>
        <div class="card"><h3>Integrations →</h3><p>Python SDK, LangGraph node, Mem0 shim, tool-agents, guardrail pattern.</p><p><a href="/docs/integrations">Read →</a></p></div>
        <div class="card"><h3>Hosting &amp; security →</h3><p>$6 VPS to K8s, auth, hardening checklist, ops signals.</p><p><a href="/docs/hosting">Read →</a></p></div>
      </div>
      <p class="muted" style="margin-top:22px">Deep canonical docs live in the repo (<code>docs/HOW_TO_USE.md</code>). This site is the curated handbook.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
</Base>
